{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664080/extras/Library_Logo_-_demo.png?t=1745176749\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scary creatures started haunting your nightmares. Your doctor tells you to look for Memory Fragments hidden within your mind to figure out : what's causing these visions exactly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664080/extras/Sleep_And_Wake_Up_By_Monster.gif?t=1745176749\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To find the Memory Fragments, you will have to search through dark forests, damp caves, ancient temples, haunted houses, and creepy catacombs...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664080/extras/GIF_Worlds_Steampage.gif?t=1745176749\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Filled with traps, these grounds are dangerous. It has been said that many who roamed too deep inside of them never returned with their full sanity...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you brave enough to face your fears?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Important : This is the playable demo of the game, and contains 2 worlds out of the 5 present in the main game.</i></strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664080?t=1745176749","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664080?t=1745176749","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664080/bdd719c707eb04e8462250d790c9f54ffe21736f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745176749","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664080/bdd719c707eb04e8462250d790c9f54ffe21736f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745176749","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664080/extras/Library_Logo_-_demo.png?t=1745176749\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scary creatures started haunting your nightmares. Your doctor tells you to look for Memory Fragments hidden within your mind to figure out : what's causing these visions exactly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664080/extras/Sleep_And_Wake_Up_By_Monster.gif?t=1745176749\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To find the Memory Fragments, you will have to search through dark forests, damp caves, ancient temples, haunted houses, and creepy catacombs...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664080/extras/GIF_Worlds_Steampage.gif?t=1745176749\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Filled with traps, these grounds are dangerous. It has been said that many who roamed too deep inside of them never returned with their full sanity...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you brave enough to face your fears?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Important : This is the playable demo of the game, and contains 2 worlds out of the 5 present in the main game.</i></strong></h2>","developers":["Protox Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3645430","name":"Escape The MonStalkers!"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664080/129788f04ec35e5338806e76482ae404b49e7c2e/header.jpg?t=1745176749","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></u